{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Marisa of Liartop Mountain",
    "steam_appid": 2514630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa of Liartop Mountain is an adventure role-playing game where the player's choice and the dice will determine the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimu ventures through a mysterious book, to find Marisa who has disappeared.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff1cGameplay\uff1e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA tale of an adventure changes depending on the player's choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by gamebooks, this game is full of unimaginable choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decision spins a once-in-a-lifetime adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/cab480fc6b1317e8ac67774043f33f43.avif?t=1754994221\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFuture of the battle entrusted to your wits and dice rolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure progresses with the player's discovery and wit but you may encounter monsters. Win, or lose \u2013 it depends on the dice rolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy both the feel of playing an analog game on a tabletop, and the high tempo and comfortable experience that only a digital game can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices after leveling up will affect the progression and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/ac325c30c5981ae64b932476be5cd660.poster.avif?t=1754994221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/ac325c30c5981ae64b932476be5cd660.webm?t=1754994221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/ac325c30c5981ae64b932476be5cd660.mp4?t=1754994221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/2e87a815969b185f81e553b1a0493b5e.avif?t=1754994221\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe 4 girls who talk over your adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters from the Scarlet Devil Mansion will appear in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remilia, Flandre, Patchouli and Sakuya; the 4 of them will interject whenever they have the chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their opinions could help your adventure, but it\u2019s up to you to listen to them or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Participating creators</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario Outline: Hugo Hall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: RD-Sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme song sung by Sarasa Toumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Master: NEKI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first of a series of Tabletop-style RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on Touhou Project. The game content includes original interpretations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa of Liartop Mountain is an adventure role-playing game where the player's choice and the dice will determine the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimu ventures through a mysterious book, to find Marisa who has disappeared.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff1cGameplay\uff1e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA tale of an adventure changes depending on the player's choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by gamebooks, this game is full of unimaginable choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decision spins a once-in-a-lifetime adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/cab480fc6b1317e8ac67774043f33f43.avif?t=1754994221\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFuture of the battle entrusted to your wits and dice rolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure progresses with the player's discovery and wit but you may encounter monsters. Win, or lose \u2013 it depends on the dice rolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy both the feel of playing an analog game on a tabletop, and the high tempo and comfortable experience that only a digital game can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices after leveling up will affect the progression and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/ac325c30c5981ae64b932476be5cd660.poster.avif?t=1754994221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/ac325c30c5981ae64b932476be5cd660.webm?t=1754994221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/ac325c30c5981ae64b932476be5cd660.mp4?t=1754994221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/2e87a815969b185f81e553b1a0493b5e.avif?t=1754994221\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe 4 girls who talk over your adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters from the Scarlet Devil Mansion will appear in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remilia, Flandre, Patchouli and Sakuya; the 4 of them will interject whenever they have the chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their opinions could help your adventure, but it\u2019s up to you to listen to them or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Participating creators</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario Outline: Hugo Hall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: RD-Sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme song sung by Sarasa Toumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Master: NEKI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first of a series of Tabletop-style RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on Touhou Project. The game content includes original interpretations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Marisa of Liartop Mountain is an adventure RPG where the player's choice and the dice will determine the path. Reimu ventures through a mysterious book, to find Marisa who disappeared... but Reimu is not alone. 4 girls will guide, help, and support Reimu on her journey... While having a blast!",
